  "html": "<p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">续陆机《诗》作三首以寄</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">“瓮余残酒，膝有横琴”&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">削消凡骨，剖吐素心</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">怀无私恨，国有羊斟</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">搴采白苹，献飨空吟</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">兴言感悟，思我所钦</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">“瓮余残酒，膝有横琴”&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">志学十五，鬓未霜侵</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">羞夸金谷，耻赋上林</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">辛酸抚己，恐惧临深</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">曲房高卧，偃月登寻</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">“瓮余残酒，膝有横琴”</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">光含极浦，气溢遥岑</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">蜩螳不静，诸乘见临</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">池悬华露，云泻天浔</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">顾瞻形影，允望飞沉</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">金人捧露盘&nbsp; 为晋国司空大人兵败作谈笑歌</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">啸猿歌，挥慧剑，探泉河。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">誓万死、千古英哲。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">光华涣汗，纵雨侵风略度犹奢。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">恣怀无忌，痛着鞭、谈笑歧辙。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">膏粱子，铅貉女，腥膻世，固沉疴。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">扼甚腕、晓镜青娥。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">顽石动意，算一厢情愿也难得。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">此身何放，暂天涯、委顿舟车。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p>",
